    "searchText": "package links official source npm pypi extension and future release-link status for every codepot product. # package links external links are centrally configured in docs/ecosystem.json and rendered by the site. unavailable registry or hosted links remain null with tbd status. the ui hides them instead of creating broken buttons. ## available now ### codepot-openapi - source github https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot/tree/main/packages/nodejs/codepot-openapi - registry npm https //www.npmjs.com/package/codepot-openapi ### codepotg - source github https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot/tree/main/packages/python/codepotg - registry pypi https //pypi.org/project/codepotg/ ### codepotx - source github https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot/tree/main/packages/nodejs/codepotx - npm tbd until official publication ### codepotx-cli - source github https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot/tree/main/packages/nodejs/codepotx-cli - npm tbd until official publication ## final platform source - codepot lang repository https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot_lang - codepot cli crate https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot_lang/tree/main/crates/codepot-cli - codepot lsp crate https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot_lang/tree/main/crates/codepot-lsp - codepot language extension https //github.com/alidantech-org/codepot_lang/tree/main/vcode ## reserved future links the ecosystem configuration already reserves entries for - codepot lang package or release distribution - codepot cli release downloads - codepot lsp binary releases - vs code marketplace - open vsx - codepot web source and hosted application - codepot mcp source and package registry."
