    "searchText": "documentation policy codepot packages choose a codepot package and follow its complete package-specific documentation. packages each package tree contains - a package overview and learning path - installation and first-project guidance - architecture and core concepts - complete configuration and command references - examples best practices and troubleshooting - clear release-status notes. the documentation is compiled from markdown during the site build. package readmes source exports configuration models examples and tests remain the factual source for package behavior."
