    "package": "codepot-openapi",
    "description": "Define reusable fields, Zod-backed schemas, projections, arrays, optional values, and component references.",
    "snippet": "Define one canonical model and derive request/response projections from it when their meaning truly matches. - Create separate schemas when two shapes have different business meaning even if…",
